# N4 (LMX_grammar.ru.md section 17; Codex OPUS-CODEX-20261015-25): a one-operand call written as a block is the same
# call; end: call only closes its Frame. S writes the unit's k through node. Entry 7.
int: k 0
S:
    node\k: 7
end: S
fn: unit_k () int
    return: node\k
end: unit_k
call:
    S
end: call
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: unit_k(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
